# The CI workflow is kept on disk but out of git: the deploy token has no
# "workflow" scope, so a push that touches .github/workflows is refused outright.
# Restore it with `git checkout with-ci-workflow -- .github/workflows` once the
# token has that scope, or paste the file into GitHub via Actions -> new workflow,
# which needs no token at all.
.github/workflows/
